{"title":"TRACE Portfolio","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"TRACE Portfolio"},"headingText":"Evidence, not volume","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\nYour portfolio records evidence that your judgment is becoming more precise and independent.\n\nA strong portfolio does not necessarily contain more text. It shows:\n\n> **better searching → better probing → stronger evidence → more precise explanation → better judgment → independent verification**\n\n## Core evidence codes\n\n| Code | Observable capacity |\n|---|---|\n| `SEEK` | formulate and reformulate searches; trace provenance |\n| `PROMPT` | specify task, context, constraints, evidence, and output |\n| `PROBE` | isolate assumptions, sensitivities, and failure points |\n| `CONTEXT` | manage conversation state and context drift |\n| `VERIFY` | test claims against independent evidence |\n| `JUDGE` | make a defensible use/reject/modify/disclose decision |\n| `TRANSFER` | apply the method to a new problem or discipline |\n\n## Week 1 evidence\n\n- `SEEK`\n- `TRACE`\n- `VERIFY`\n\nThe Week 1 artifact is **Task 01 — Source Trace**.\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n## Evidence, not volume\n\nYour portfolio records evidence that your judgment is becoming more precise and independent.\n\nA strong portfolio does not necessarily contain more text. It shows:\n\n> **better searching → better probing → stronger evidence → more precise explanation → better judgment → independent verification**\n\n## Core evidence codes\n\n| Code | Observable capacity |\n|---|---|\n| `SEEK` | formulate and reformulate searches; trace provenance |\n| `PROMPT` | specify task, context, constraints, evidence, and output |\n| `PROBE` | isolate assumptions, sensitivities, and failure points |\n| `CONTEXT` | manage conversation state and context drift |\n| `VERIFY` | test claims against independent evidence |\n| `JUDGE` | make a defensible use/reject/modify/disclose decision |\n| `TRANSFER` | apply the method to a new problem or discipline |\n\n## Week 1 evi